---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site.mjs';

const cutoffLabel = new Date(SITE.orderCutoffISO).toLocaleDateString('en-IN', {
  day: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
});
---
<Base title="Shipping & Returns" description="How Tantu Kala ships handmade orders, and our returns & refund policy.">
  <div class="wrap py-10 max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl">Shipping & Returns</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/60">Everything you need to know before you order.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-8">Payment</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
      We accept secure <strong>UPI</strong> payment on this website. After you place an order
      you'll get an order number and a UPI payment option — tap-to-pay on mobile, scan-QR on
      desktop. We verify your payment against your order number before we dispatch.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-8">Shipping</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
      We ship across India. Orders are usually <strong>dispatched within 2 working days</strong>,
      and most reach you in about <strong>5–9 days</strong> depending on your location. We'll keep
      you posted on WhatsApp once your order is on its way. For Raksha Bandhan, please order by
      <strong>{cutoffLabel}</strong> to receive it in time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-8">Returns & Refunds</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
      Every piece is <strong>handmade to order</strong>, so we're unable to accept returns for a
      change of mind. If your order arrives <strong>damaged or incorrect</strong>, message us
      within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery with a photo and we'll make it right — a
      replacement or a full refund. Refunds go back to your original UPI account, usually within
      <strong>5–7 working days</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-8">Handmade note</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
      Because each rakhi is crocheted by hand, small variations in colour, size, and finish are
      natural and part of the charm — they aren't considered defects.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-8">Privacy</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
      This site takes no card/payment data and stores nothing on your device except your cart.
      The delivery details you enter at checkout are used only to process and ship your order.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 card p-5 bg-sand">
      <p class="text-sm text-ink/70">
        Questions? Message us on
        <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsapp}`} class="text-henna font-semibold underline">WhatsApp</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
